  <!--EN: An advanced climatic manipulator designed for environmental transformation. By extracting atmospheric moisture and seeding it with ultra-cold nano-crystals, the snow spewer blankets entire regions with continuous snowfall, turning any landscape into a frozen wonderland.-->
  <VCE_SnowSpewer_Causer.description>一种浓郁的奶油假日饮料，由牛奶、鸡蛋和糖制成，通常添加肉豆蔻香料。蛋酒甜美而令人心旷神怡，但当掺入酒精时，它的节日魅力就会增强，带来温暖，并可能导致过度放纵。</VCE_SnowSpewer_Causer.description>
